%% Sprint 2 - Diagramme de sequence : Entrainement et evaluation d'un modele par phase de vol
sequenceDiagram
    actor DS as Data Scientist
    participant UI as Page Entrainement (Streamlit)
    participant SP as ServicePrediction
    participant ML as ModeleML (phase)
    participant SHAP as ServiceExplicabilite
    participant DB as SQLite (models_metadata, predictions)

    DS->>UI: Choisit la phase de vol (ex. Cruise)
    UI->>SP: entrainerModele(phase, datasetTrain)
    SP->>ML: fit(X_train, y_train)
    ML-->>SP: modele entraine
    SP->>ML: predict(X_test)
    ML-->>SP: y_pred
    SP->>SP: calculerMetriques(y_test, y_pred)
    SP->>SP: comparerBaseline(metriques)
    SP->>SHAP: expliquer(modele, X_test)
    SHAP-->>SP: contributions par variable
    SP->>DB: sauvegarderModele(metriques, params)
    DB-->>SP: OK
    SP-->>UI: rapport de performance + SHAP
    UI-->>DS: Affiche MAE/RMSE/R2 et feature importance
